3. Configures the router to:
   - Add link-bandwidth extended communities to received IPv6 routes from directly connected EBGP peers (`add-to-received-ebgp`)
   - Allow sending of link-bandwidth extended communities in IPv6 routes to EBGP peers (`send-to-ebgp`)
