To configure BGP ORF negotiation for receiving route filters from a peer on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    outbound-route-filtering
        extended-community
            send-orf
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration enables the router to negotiate the send capability in BGP outbound route filtering (ORF) with the peer, allowing the peer to send route filters. The `send-orf` command under the `extended-community` context is specifically designed for this purpose.
