## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to enable receiving BGP outbound route filters (ORF) from a specified peer during ORF negotiation, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        outbound-route-filtering
            extended-community
                send-orf
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

If you need to apply this configuration to a specific BGP group or neighbor, use these variations:

For a BGP group:
```
configure router
    bgp
        group <group-name>
            outbound-route-filtering
                extended-community
                    send-orf
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

For a specific BGP neighbor:
```
configure router
    bgp
        group <group-name>
            neighbor <ip-address>
                outbound-route-filtering
                    extended-community
                        send-orf
                        exit
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```
