To enable BGP path selection based on end-to-end IGP metrics for routes spanning multiple ASes on a Nokia router, use the following configuration:

```
configure router
    bgp
        best-path-selection
            no ignore-nh-metric
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration ensures BGP considers the IGP metric to the next-hop when selecting the best path, which is particularly important for routes spanning multiple ASes where end-to-end IGP metrics should influence path selection.
