Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To configure the Nokia router to ignore AS-path length for all IPv6 multicast routes during BGP best path selection, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        best-path-selection
            as-path-ignore mcast-ipv6
```

This configuration will modify the BGP best path selection process to disregard AS-path length specifically for IPv6 multicast routes.
