## User question:
How to configure Nokia router to ignore AS-path length for all IPv6 multicast routes during BGP best path selection?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure the Nokia router to ignore AS-path length for all IPv6 multicast routes during BGP best path selection, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        best-path-selection
            as-path-ignore mcast-ipv6
```

This configuration will modify the BGP best path selection process to disregard AS-path length specifically for IPv6 multicast routes.
