Here are the CLI configuration commands to configure a BGP group with route reflector cluster ID 192.168.10.5 and ORR location 8, allowing local fallback:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        cluster 192.168.10.5 orr-location 8 allow-local-fallback
exit
