To configure a Nokia router with BGP confederation AS 65001 and member ASes 65100 and 65200, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        confederation
            confed-as 65001
            exit
            member-as 65100
            member-as 65200
            exit
        exit
    exit
``` 

This configuration:
1. Sets the main confederation AS to 65001
2. Adds member ASes 65100 and 65200 to the confederation

The router will now participate in the BGP confederation with these AS numbers.
