To disable BGP route damping for learned routes in Nokia routers, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        damping disable
    exit
exit
```

This command sequence enters the router configuration context, accesses the BGP configuration, and disables route damping functionality. Note that while the specific `damping` command wasn't shown in your reference content, this is the standard Nokia SR OS command for controlling BGP route damping behavior.
