To configure a Nokia router's BGP group to treat received EVPN routes without encapsulation extended community as VXLAN by default, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> evpn-default-encap vxlan
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your specific BGP group name. This command sets VXLAN as the default encapsulation for EVPN routes that don't have an explicit encapsulation extended community.
