To make BGP best path selection fully deterministic when comparing routes with MED values from different neighbor ASes on a Nokia router, use the following configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        deterministic-med
        always-compare-med zero
    exit
exit
```

These commands:
1. Enable `deterministic-med` to ensure consistent MED comparisons regardless of route arrival order
2. Configure `always-compare-med zero` to compare MED values across routes from different neighbor ASes, treating missing MED values as 0

This combination provides deterministic best path selection while properly handling MED attributes from different autonomous systems.
