To make BGP best path selection fully deterministic when comparing routes with MED values from different neighbor ASes, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    deterministic-med
    always-compare-med zero
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables `deterministic-med` to group paths by neighbor AS before MED comparison
2. Configures `always-compare-med zero` to compare MED across different AS neighbors while treating missing MED as 0

The combination ensures consistent best path selection regardless of route arrival order.
