To configure a Nokia router to treat EBGP and IBGP paths equally for IPv6 VPN routes in BGP best path selection, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        ebgp-ibgp-equal vpn-ipv6
    exit
exit
```

This configuration will make the BGP decision process ignore the difference between EBGP and IBGP paths when selecting the best path for IPv6 VPN routes.
