To configure Nokia routers to treat EBGP and IBGP routes equally for labeled IPv6 routes in BGP best path selection, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    ebgp-ibgp-equal label-ipv6
exit
```

This command ensures that the BGP decision process ignores the difference between EBGP and IBGP routes for labeled IPv6 routes during best path selection.
