To configure Nokia routers for VPN route exchange between different autonomous systems in a BGP environment, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    autonomous-system <your-local-as>
    router-id <your-router-id>
    rapid-withdrawal
    enable-peer-tracking
    extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv4
    group <ebgp-group-name>
