        disable-capability-negotiation
        enforce-first-as
        loop-detect ignore-loop
        neighbor <remote-peer-ip>
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

For VPN route leaking between autonomous systems:
```
configure router bgp rib-management vpn-ipv4
    leak-import "<policy-name>"
    exit
```

If you need to enable EIBGP load balancing for VPN routes:
```
configure router bgp best-path-selection
    ebgp-ibgp-equal vpn-ipv4
    exit
```

Replace `<your-local-as>`, `<your-router-id>`, `<ebgp-group-name>`, `<remote-as>`, `<remote-peer-ip>`, and `<policy-name>` with your specific values.
