To configure origin validation processing for both labeled IPv4 and unlabeled IPv6 routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```bash
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    enable-origin-validation label-ipv4 ipv6
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your specific BGP group name. This command enables origin validation for labeled IPv4 routes and unlabeled IPv6 routes within the specified BGP group.
