How to configure huawei routers to import all received VPN-IP routes into the dummy VRF for BGP next-hop resolution without regard to route targets?
```json
{
  "commands": [
    "ip vpn-instance dummy",
    "ipv4-family",
    "route-distinguisher 1:1",
    "vpn-target 1:1 both",
    "import route-policy ANY",
    "quit",
    "quit",
    "route-policy ANY permit node 10",
    "if-match any",
    "commit"
  ]
}
```
