## User question:
How to configure a Nokia router to restrict BGP next-hop resolution for labeled routes to only use LSPs that have been explicitly tagged?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to restrict BGP next-hop resolution for labeled routes to only use LSPs that have been explicitly tagged, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            label-route-transport-tunnel explicit-only
```

This configuration ensures that BGP will only resolve next-hops for labeled routes using LSPs that have been explicitly tagged.
