To enable BGP extended community filtering for outbound route filtering on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        outbound-route-filtering
            extended-community
                send-orf
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

If you need to specify particular extended communities for filtering, you can include them in the `send-orf` command like this:

```
configure router
    bgp
        outbound-route-filtering
            extended-community
                send-orf target:64500:100
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `target:64500:100` with your specific extended community values as needed.
