    group <group-name>
        family vpn-ipv4
        neighbor <neighbor-ip>
            family vpn-ipv4
            next-hop-self
exit all
```

For enabling the specific capability to receive these routes with IPv6 next-hop (AFI=2), ensure your BGP session supports both VPN-IPv4 and IPv6 address families. The above configuration enables the basic VPN-IPv4 capability. For advanced configurations involving IPv6 next-hops, additional context-specific settings may be required depending on your network setup.
