```

If you need to enable additional features like rapid withdrawal or add-paths for multicast VPN IPv6, you can add these commands:

```
configure router bgp
    rapid-withdrawal
    add-paths
        mvpn-ipv6 send 16 receive
        exit
    exit
```

These commands will:
1. Enable BGP rapid updates for multicast VPN IPv6
2. Configure the BGP group and neighbor to support both IPv4 and IPv6 VPN families including multicast
3. Optionally enable rapid withdrawal and add-paths capability for multicast VPN IPv6 routes
