The ipv6-family vpn-instance command enables and enters the BGP VPN instance IPv6 address family view.
The undo ipv6-family vpn-instance command disables the BGP VPN instance IPv6 address family view and deletes the configurations in the view.
By default, the IPv6 address family view of BGP is disabled.
