To configure long-lived graceful restart for the label-IPv6 address family on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        graceful-restart
            long-lived
                label-ipv6
                    stale-time 3600
                    forwarding-hold-time 7200
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables graceful restart at the BGP level
2. Configures long-lived graceful restart specifically for label-IPv6
3. Sets the stale time to 3600 seconds (1 hour)
4. Sets the forwarding hold time to 7200 seconds (2 hours)

Adjust the `stale-time` and `forwarding-hold-time` values according to your specific requirements.
