To configure a Nokia router for resolving next-hop of unlabeled IPv6 BGP routes using shortcut tunnels, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        use-bgp-routes
        policy <policy-name>
    exit
exit
```

Where `<policy-name>` is the route policy that controls which IP routes in RTM are eligible to resolve the BGP next-hop addresses. This configuration enables recursive next-hop resolution using BGP routes for unlabeled IPv6 routes.
