Here are the CLI configuration commands to configure the Nokia router to report both IPv6 unicast (unlabeled) and IPv4 VPN (SAFI 128) address families to a BMP monitoring station:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "BMP_STATION_NAME"
            report-local-routes
            family ipv6
            family vpn-ipv4
            connection
                # Configure BMP station connection parameters here (e.g., remote-address, port)
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Note: Replace `BMP_STATION_NAME` with your specific BMP station name and configure the connection parameters as required. This configuration enables reporting of both IPv6 unicast (family ipv6) and IPv4 VPN (family vpn-ipv4) address families to the specified BMP station.
