Here are the CLI configuration commands to configure a Nokia router's BMP station to report both labeled IPv6 and VPN IPv4 address families:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "BMP_STATION_NAME"
            report-local-routes
            family label-ipv6
            family vpn-ipv4
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `"BMP_STATION_NAME"` with your desired BMP station identifier. This configuration enables the BMP station to monitor and report both labeled IPv6 routes (using `family label-ipv6`) and VPN IPv4 routes (using `family vpn-ipv4`), along with enabling local route reporting.
