To enable BGP flowspec validation on a Nokia router, you need to navigate to the BGP configuration context and configure the appropriate validation parameters. Here are the CLI commands:

```
configure router
bgp
flowspec
validate-destination
exit
```

This sequence enters the BGP configuration context, accesses the flowspec sub-context, and enables destination validation for flowspec rules. Note that exact validation capabilities may depend on your specific software version and platform.
