To enable BGP graceful restart helper functionality on a Nokia router for all supported address families, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
    exit
```

This command enables BGP graceful restart helper mode globally for all supported address families (IPv4, IPv6, VPN-IPv4, VPN-IPv6, Label-IPv4, Label-IPv6, L2-VPN, RTC, Flow-IPv4, and Flow-IPv6).

If you also want to enable graceful restart support for NOTIFICATION messages, add:
```
configure router bgp graceful-restart
    enable-notification
    exit
```
