To configure a Nokia router to enforce a locally-defined restart time of 300 seconds for all AFI/SAFI included in a BGP peer's Graceful Restart capability, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp graceful-restart
    restart-time 300
exit
```

This sets the global BGP graceful restart timer to 300 seconds, which will apply to all AFI/SAFI supported by the router's Graceful Restart capability. The configuration is applied at the `config>router>bgp>graceful-restart` hierarchy level.
------------
