## Proposed answer:
To modify BGP best path selection to exclude the resolved distance metric when comparing routes with identical NLRI from base router BGP peers, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp best-path-selection always-compare-med zero
```

This ensures MED is compared even if paths have different neighbor AS, and routes without a MED attribute are treated as having a value of 0.
