To configure inbound route filtering on a Nokia router using BGP with the policy "CUST_A_IN" followed by the logical expression "AND CUST_B_PREF", use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        import "CUST_A_IN AND CUST_B_PREF"
    exit
exit
```

This applies the specified policy and logical expression to all inbound BGP routes. If you need to apply this only to specific neighbors or groups, you would place the `import` command under the respective neighbor or group configuration instead.
