To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per unlabeled IPv4 unicast prefix and disable receiving multiple routes per prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        ipv4 send 8 receive none
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
- Enables advertising up to 8 paths for unlabeled IPv4 prefixes (`ipv4 send 8`)
- Disables receiving multiple routes per prefix (`receive none`)
