To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 labeled-unicast IPv4 paths per prefix and negotiate to receive multiple paths, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        label-ipv4 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables the router to:
- Advertise up to 8 labeled-unicast IPv4 paths per prefix (`send 8`)
- Negotiate the capability to receive multiple paths (`receive`)
------------
As a network device expert, please determine whether the following answer correctly responds to the user's question based on the router configuration manual. Only output "Correct" or "Incorrect" without any explanation or additional information. You must make your own judgment based on the Router configuration manual provided to you, not on your own knowledge.
---
## User question:
How to configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 labeled-unicast IPv4 paths per prefix and negotiate to receive multiple paths?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 labeled-unicast IPv4 paths per prefix and negotiate to receive multiple paths, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        label-ipv4 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables the router to:
- Advertise up to 8 labeled-unicast IPv4 paths per prefix (`send 8`)
- Negotiate the capability to receive multiple paths (`receive`)
