To set the route preference to 150 for labeled-unicast BGP routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    preference 150 label-ipv4
exit
```

This command sets the preference value specifically for labeled-unicast IPv4 BGP routes to 150. The lower the preference value, the more preferred the route is, so a higher value like 150 makes these routes less preferred compared to routes with lower preference values.
