To configure your Nokia router to import BGP routes from another routing instance into the base router's unlabeled-IPv4 RIB using the policies "INTERNAL_POLICY_1" and "BACKUP_POLICY", use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        import "INTERNAL_POLICY_1" "BACKUP_POLICY"
    exit
exit
```

This configuration applies at the global BGP level. If you need to apply these policies to specific BGP groups or neighbors, navigate to the respective group or neighbor context under `config>router>bgp` before executing the `import` command.
