To configure a Nokia router to set the BGP local preference attribute to 200 for incoming routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    local-preference 200
exit
```

Alternatively, if you want to apply this setting to a specific BGP group or neighbor:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    local-preference 200
exit
```

Or for a specific neighbor:
```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    local-preference 200
exit
```
