To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per multicast IPv6 VPN prefix and negotiate to receive multiple multicast routes per IPv6 VPN prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp add-paths
    mcast-vpn-ipv6 send 8 receive
exit
