To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per multicast IPv6 VPN prefix and negotiate to receive multiple routes for this prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        mvpn-ipv6 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables BGP add-paths capability globally
2. Specifically configures multicast IPv6 VPN (mvpn-ipv6) to:
   - Send up to 8 paths per prefix (`send 8`)
   - Negotiate to receive multiple paths (`receive`)
