To configure your Nokia router's BGP for the requested multipath settings, use these CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8
    ebgp-multipath 4
    ibgp-multipath 6
exit
```

These commands will:
- Set the overall maximum of 8 equal-cost paths per prefix
- Limit EBGP routes to 4 paths
- Limit IBGP routes to 6 paths
------------
As a network device expert, please determine whether the following answer correctly responds to the user's question based on the router configuration manual. Only output "Correct" or "Incorrect" without any explanation or additional information. You must make your own judgment based on the Router configuration manual provided to you, not on your own knowledge.
---
## User question:
"How to configure Nokia router BGP to allow a maximum of 8 equal-cost paths per prefix, with separate limits of 4 paths for EBGP routes and 6 paths for IBGP routes?"
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure your Nokia router's BGP for the requested multipath settings, use these CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8
    ebgp-multipath 4
    ibgp-multipath 6
exit
```

These commands will:
- Set the overall maximum of 8 equal-cost paths per prefix
- Limit EBGP routes to 4 paths
- Limit IBGP routes to 6 paths
---
## Router configuration manual:
CLIs:
multipath <max-paths> [ ebgp <ebgp-max-paths> ] [ ibgp <ibgp-max-paths> ] [ restrict { same-neighbor-as | exact-as-path } ]
no multipath
FuncDef:
This command enables BGP multipath for all address families that support ECMP forwarding.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'max-paths', 'Info': 'Specifies the maximum number of multipaths per prefix/NLRI if ebgp-max-paths or ibgp-max-paths does not apply. Values-1 to 64.'}
{'Parameters': 'egp-max-paths', 'Info': 'Specifies the maximum number of multipaths per prefix/NLRI when the best path is an EBGP learned route. Values-1 to 64.'}
{'Parameters': 'ibgp-max-paths', 'Info': 'Specifies the maximum number of multipaths per prefix/NLRI when the best path is an IBGP learned route. Values-1 to 64.'}
{'Parameters': 'restrict same-neighbor-as', 'Info': 'Specifies that the non-best path must have the same neighbor AS in its AS path as the best path.'}
{'Parameters': 'restrict exact-as-path-as', 'Info': 'Specifies that the non-best path must have the same AS path as the best path.'}
