To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per multicast VPN IPv4 prefix and disable receiving multiple routes for the same prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        mcast-vpn-ipv4 send 8 receive none
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables the add-paths feature under BGP
2. Specifically configures multicast VPN IPv4 prefixes to:
   - Advertise up to 8 paths per prefix (`send 8`)
   - Disable receiving multiple paths for the same prefix (`receive none`)
