To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 3 paths per multicast VPN IPv6 prefix while disabling the ability to receive multiple paths for the same prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        vpn-ipv6 send 3 receive none
    exit
