## User question:
"How to configure Nokia routers to encode type/subtype in advertised BGP MVPN routes as 0x010b?"
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure Nokia routers to encode type/subtype in advertised BGP MVPN routes as 0x010b, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    rapid-update mvpn-ipv4
exit
```

This enables BGP rapid update for the MVPN IPv4 address family, which includes the type/subtype encoding 0x010b in the advertised BGP MVPN routes.
