## Proposed answer:
To enable inter-AS label security for VPN IPv6 family on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    enforce-first-as
    extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv6
exit
```

These commands will:
1. Enable enforcement of the first AS in the AS_PATH for EBGP sessions (`enforce-first-as`)
2. Configure BGP to advertise the capability to receive VPN IPv6 routes with proper next-hop encoding (`extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv6`)
